Liquid Neon wallpapers — bundled image assets
=============================================

The 38 WebP wallpapers in this directory are owner-authored work.

Origin
------
Skyy (the owner of Sky High Infinite Techwork) generated the 42 PNG originals
himself with an AI image generator on 2026-09-08 and supplied them to
engineering on 2026-09-09. They are his own output, wholly owned. There is no
stock-library licence behind them, no third-party rights holder, and therefore
no indemnification gap.

Confirmed by Skyy on 2026-09-09 (SKY-11591, child of SKY-11378).

This permits commercial redistribution inside the Mythos Writer installer with
no attribution requirement and no non-commercial restriction — the same clean
footing as the Kokoro model weights bundled under
electron-main/resources/kokoro/LICENSE (SKY-11230).

Derivation
----------
Each shipped file is a 16:9 crop of one original, re-encoded to WebP. No other
image is composited in; nothing is upscaled; no third-party asset, font, or
texture is layered on top. The crop and encode are fully reproducible from
scripts/wallpapers/wallpapers.manifest.json.

The PNG originals are preserved in design-assets/wallpapers/originals/ with a
SHA-256 per file in PROVENANCE.json, outside the shipped bundle. They are the
source of truth if a crop ever has to be redone.

Pipeline notes: docs/design/wallpaper-pipeline.md
